  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dilema_SensoresUrbanos
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Sensores e consulta p\xFAblica"
  _titleEn: Sensors and public consultation
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Sensores urbanos geram dados \xFAteis para planejar a cidade, mas tamb\xE9m
    registram a rotina de quem vive nela. Decidir quem coleta, guarda e acessa esses
    dados \xE9 uma escolha pol\xEDtica, n\xE3o s\xF3 t\xE9cnica."
  _summaryEn: Urban sensors produce useful data for planning, but they also record
    the routine of the people who live there. Deciding who collects, stores and accesses
    that data is a political choice, not just a technical one.
  _realWorld: "Em Toronto, o bairro Quayside seria feito com a Sidewalk Labs, do
    grupo Alphabet. Ann Cavoukian, especialista em privacidade, saiu em 2018, e a
    empresa desistiu em maio de 2020, citando incerteza econ\xF4mica."
  _realWorldEn: In Toronto, Sidewalk Labs, part of Alphabet, was to build the Quayside
    district. Privacy expert Ann Cavoukian left in 2018, and the company pulled out
    in May 2020, citing economic uncertainty.
  _tradeOffs: "Consulta p\xFAblica custa tempo e dinheiro, mas d\xE1 legitimidade.
    Sem ela, o projeto avan\xE7a r\xE1pido e pode perder a confian\xE7a dos moradores."
  _tradeOffsEn: Public consultation costs time and money but brings legitimacy. Without
    it, a project moves fast and can lose the trust of residents.
  _sources:
  - Label: Sidewalk Toronto (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sidewalk_Toronto
  - Label: 'The Logic: Ann Cavoukian resigns as adviser to Sidewalk Labs (2018)'
    Url: https://thelogic.co/news/privacy-expert-ann-cavoukian-resigns-as-adviser-to-sidewalk-labs/
